<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping - Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 5.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping - Tuticorin cargoes - Dec 5.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on December 5:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>General	    226/--- (LDD)    172/--  Tiger Creek	03/12</p>
<p>Raw Cashew	 499/--- (ULD)  5,685/--  Rugua		04/12</p>
<p>Rock Phospate    ---/--- (ULD)    ---/--  Komsomolets	30/11</p>
<p>DAP		7,695/--- (ULD)  8,750/--  Visvilet	   30/11</p>
<p>Urea	     5,675/--- (ULD) 16,773/--  Pearl Prosperity 19/11</p>
<p>DAP		3,341/--- (ULD)  6,868/--  Tigea		01/12</p>
<p>Coal	    13,052/--- (ULD) 14,363/--  Tamil Kamaraj    04/12</p>
<p>Scrap	    1,000/--- (ULD)    ---/--  Shahib	     21/11</p>
<p>---------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>(Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
